## 1. Use-Case Name
Create account

### 1.1 Brief Description
A User registers by entering an email, a username and a password. The system validates the data, creates the account, and confirms it. The new Registered User can then log in, share projects and comment.

Behavior as executable scenarios: [UC1 feature file](features/uc1_create_account.feature)

